    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολγός</span></b> , ὁ, Tarentine
		word for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόειος ἀσκός</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			10.187
		</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. γενέσθαι δεῖ σε,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκὸν δεδάρθαι</span>
			 (v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5
				</span></i>
			 fin.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				963
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολγὸν αἵνειν
				ʽἀνεῖν̓,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκὸν δείρειν</span>
