			 (fem.), <i><span class="en">
				Blaes.
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολγῶ: νέφος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
